{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "id": "msg_011Ch1os12oX8Z4BuYkvNYQT", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I signed off with one confirmed bug filed. The build is not clean, so the sign-off rests on the areas I covered, not a full pass.\n\n**Bug filed (logged by the developer):**\n- **Add note, dismissal after a note-type swap:** I typed \"zebra\" into Front, changed the type to \"Basic (and reversed card)\", then pressed Back. The screen closed with no \"Discard current input?\" prompt and the text was lost. The same Back with no swap does show the prompt. A second run confirmed that typing after the swap does produce the prompt, so the baseline seems to be reset when the model is swapped.\n\n**Checked, no defects found:**\n- **Filtered decks:** building from `deck:Spanish` pulled in all 4 cards and Spanish dropped to 0. The criteria dropdown lists 11 entries, and \"Relative overdueness\" persisted after rebuild and reopen.\n- **Deck options, New cards:** the \"This deck\", \"Preset\", and \"Today only\" values persisted after save and reopen. A preset change reached Spanish, and per-deck overrides showed correctly in the deck list counts. Cancel and Discard behaved, and rotation kept unsaved input.\n- **Notes:** a saved add cleared the editor with no false prompt. Removing a tag on \"comer\" persisted.\n\n**Not covered:**\n- Changing the note type on an existing note (Edit note).\n- The second filter in the filtered deck builder.\n- Checking the criteria list against the scheduler's full set. I could only confirm that 11 entries are shown."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 873, "cache_read_input_tokens": 256984, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 873}, "output_tokens": 5, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "56476ead-1448-4ad9-95ff-43a27c3f9224", "uuid": "d71c5ea1-4588-4393-bca2-f4444eaacd70", "timestamp": "2026-11-13T23:38:55.528Z", "request_id": "req_011Ch1orzkvbu55APzT74e9f"}
